msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:359
msgid "Allows users to create, edit, and delete roles and to choose the default role."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:377
