#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:411
msgid "Manage General Settings"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:412
msgid "Allows users to manage the settings of projects, document submission, support, the dashboard and the menu, and to configure plugins."
